{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36253","headline":"赠美人四首 二 · 方干","name":"赠美人四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严冬忽作看花日，盛暑翻爲见雪时。\n坐上弄娇声不转，尊前掩笑意难知。\n含歌媚盼如桃叶，妙舞轻盈似柳枝。\n年几未多犹怯在，些些私语怕人疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}